WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:43.166 --> 00:00:44.458
Dear LeBron

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:46.916
I'm sorry this had to happen this way

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:49.208
That I didn't tell you sooner

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.375
Claiming the O'Brien Throne with you

00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:54.750
was one of the proudest moments of my life

00:00:56.916 --> 00:01:00.166
And I will be forever grateful for the lessons you've taught me

00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:07.083
But I can no longer fight in your shadow

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:18.166
Sure, we had our differences

00:01:18.875 --> 00:01:20.375
But the real problem

00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:22.375
is that we're very much the same

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:27.083
Many men succumb to the allure of rings and superteams

00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:29.416
only to obscure a deeper desire

00:01:29.416 --> 00:01:31.708
to be The Man

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.041
While this chapter comes to a close

00:01:35.041 --> 00:01:37.125
a new door is opened

00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:41.250
beyond which lies the knowledge of my true potential

00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:43.333
I may find that I was mistaken

00:01:44.791 --> 00:01:46.250
That I needed you all along

00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:48.791
Or maybe I'll discover

00:01:50.291 --> 00:01:52.833
that I am more powerful than I ever dreamed

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.958
And so I've set sail for the edge of the world

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:59.500
But if I find that this world is indeed round

00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:01.833
then maybe one day

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.875
my journey will lead me back to you

00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:09.125
In my stead awaits another

00:02:09.916 --> 00:02:12.166
You may recall his words from last year

00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:14.791
Well, his wish has been granted

00:02:16.333 --> 00:02:17.500
There will be...

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:18.958
A new...

00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:20.333
King in the East

00:02:30.708 --> 00:02:32.708
King James is late to his own meeting

00:02:33.041 --> 00:02:35.291
Doesn’t bode well for us getting out of this slump

00:02:35.291 --> 00:02:37.791
Hopefully he’s finalizing a trade for Kevin

00:02:38.041 --> 00:02:39.041
Am I right?

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:40.750
Freakin' Kevin

00:02:41.041 --> 00:02:42.208
What is that?

00:02:43.125 --> 00:02:44.125
That's odd

00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:47.000
Some sort of pregnant raven

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.041
Oh no...

00:02:48.041 --> 00:02:49.708
WOJ BOMB!! OH SH-

