00:24:28.916 --> 00:24:36.249
It’s a rant. A Van Gundian rant, Tobias. These monks have taken a vow of no silence

00:24:37.374 --> 00:24:45.749
[singing]
Dwight Howard is always waffling and complaining. He is a coach killer

00:24:46.124 --> 00:24:51.916
Ah, yeah, that’s lovely. I could listen to that for minutes before getting annoyed 

