[singing]
foul

00:25:06.333 --> 00:25:08.124
[singing]
And if you flop…

00:25:08.124 --> 00:25:10.958
[singing]
You should be fined millions of…

00:25:10.958 --> 00:25:12.374
[singing]
gold!

00:25:12.374 --> 00:25:14.874
[singing]
And if you flop…

00:25:14.874 --> 00:25:17.874
[singing]
You should be suspended from the…

00:25:17.874 --> 00:25:21.166
