Because flopping ruins the game!

00:25:24.333 --> 00:25:32.249
[singing]
But they don’t listen to us

00:25:32.249 --> 00:25:33.624
[laughs] Brother Stan!

00:25:33.624 --> 00:25:34.416
Brother Jeff! 

